# Generated preview page (docs/preview.html)
# ------------------------------------------
# A frozen HTML snapshot of every screen, produced by rendering the running app
# and inlining its CSS and images. It is ~360 KB of machine-generated markup and
# goes stale the moment the UI changes, so it is deliberately NOT committed —
# regenerate it instead of trusting an old copy.
